      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(2) The Vacancy Control Board, consisting of the Deputy Mayor, City Administrator, the Director of the Budget and the Personnel Director appointed on January 24, 1966 is hereby continued in operation for the purpose of investigating and recommending for approval by the Mayor of requests for the filling of positions in these agencies.",
